sequenceDiagram
    participant Node as LeadNode
    participant Index as LearnedIndex
    participant Tuner as PidTuner
    participant Leaf as Leaf Model (Anchor & PidState)

    Note over Node,Index: Key Insertions & Drift Trigger
    loop during Put operations
        Node->>Index: record_insert(key)
    end
    Index-->>Node: should_pid = true (every PID_ADJUST_INTERVAL)

    Note over Node,Leaf: Online PID Error Compensation
    Node->>Node: run_pid_adjustment()
    loop for each leaf with sufficient samples (>= 20)
        Node->>Tuner: adjust(&mut pid_state, &mut anchor, correct, outside)
        Tuner->>Tuner: compute error = actual_ratio - 0.95
        Tuner->>Tuner: update Proportional, Integral, Derivative states
        Tuner->>Leaf: adjust anchor.scale (+/- 0.05) & anchor.offset (+/- 0.01)
    end
